      "x": 100,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 500,
      "text": "ADMIN DASHBOARD API                           MIXPANEL EVENT PIPELINE\n═══════════════════                           ═══════════════════════\n\n┌──────────────┐                              ┌──────────────────────┐\n│  Admin User  │                              │  Handler / Service   │\n│  (OWNER/     │                              │  (Auth, App, Sync,   │\n│   ADMIN)     │                              │   Billing)           │\n└──────┬───────┘                              └──────────┬───────────┘\n       │                                                 │\n       ▼                                                 ▼\n┌──────────────┐                              ┌──────────────────────┐\n│  AuthMW +    │                              │  EventTracker        │\n│  AdminMW     │                              │  (interface)         │\n└──────┬───────┘                              └──────────┬───────────┘\n       │                                                 │\n       ▼                                          ┌──────┴──────┐\n┌──────────────┐                                  │             │\n│  AdminHandler│                            ┌─────▼─────┐ ┌─────▼─────┐\n│  (4 endpoints)│                           │ Mixpanel  │ │  Noop     │\n└──────┬───────┘                            │ Client    │ │  Tracker  │\n       │                                    │ (prod)    │ │  (dev)    │\n       ▼                                    └─────┬─────┘ └───────────┘\n┌──────────────┐                                  │\n│ AdminRepo    │                                  ▼\n│ (Postgres)   │                            ┌───────────┐\n└──────┬───────┘                            │ Mixpanel  │\n       │                                    │ HTTP API  │\n       ▼                                    │ /track    │\n┌──────────────┐                            │ /engage   │\n│  PostgreSQL  │                            └───────────┘\n│  (existing   │\n│   tables)    │\n└──────────────┘\n\nENDPOINTS:                                    EVENTS:\n  GET /admin/users                              user_signup\n  GET /admin/onboarding                         app_selected\n  GET /admin/sync                               sync_started\n  GET /admin/billing                            billing_subscription_created\n                                                billing_activated\n                                                billing_cancelled\n                                                billing_payment_failed",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
